            line(x1="3", y1="10", x2="21", y2="10")
        h3(style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;") Reserva Anticipada
        p(style="font-size: 11px; color: #58718e; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.45;") Aparta tu cupo desde tu dispositivo y llega directo a tu sitio libre[cite: 8].

      .feature-card(style="padding: 18px; border-radius: 12px;")
        div(style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(29,184,105,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(29,184,105,0.25); color: #1db869; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;")
          svg(style="width: 18px; height: 18px;", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="2")
            path(d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10")
            path(d="m9 12 2 2 4-4")
        h3(style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;") Pago Digital Seguro
        p(style="font-size: 11px; color: #58718e; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.45;") Olvídate de monedas y tiquetes físicos con pagos encriptados al instante[cite: 8].

      .feature-card(style="padding: 18px; border-radius: 12px;")
        div(style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(43,126,201,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(43,126,201,0.25); color: #2b7ec9; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;")
          svg(style="width: 18px; height: 18px;", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="2")
            path(d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z")
            circle(cx="12", cy="10", r="3")
        h3(style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;") Disponibilidad GPS
        p(style="font-size: 11px; color: #58718e; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.45;") Sensores que actualizan celdas libres en tiempo real sin dar vueltas[cite: 8].

      .feature-card(style="padding: 18px; border-radius: 12px;")
        div(style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(29,184,105,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(29,184,105,0.25); color: #1db869; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;")
          svg(style="width: 18px; height: 18px;", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="2")
